# Suspicious Executable File Creation | T1564 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/file/file_event/file_event_win_susp_executable_creation.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=11 (TargetFilename IN ("*:\\$Recycle.Bin.exe", "*:\\Documents and Settings.exe", "*:\\MSOCache.exe", "*:\\PerfLogs.exe", "*:\\Recovery.exe", "*.bat.exe", "*.sys.exe"))
